-- head-high undergrowth (BushA / BushB / Fern / Mushrooms / MossRock), thicker on the rim, at tree feet, along the dirt
-- paths and round the camps; (4) the red-eye bushes (Decor DarkBush / RedEye) get warm amber eyes; (5) step stones where
-- the paths meet the creek; (6) W_Tree_A in the woods uses the deeper green texture. No faces on props, no new lights.
-- Output: Map.Decor.WoodsDress (Cell_x_z Models of 64 studs, ready for a client distance cull), destroyed and rebuilt on
-- every run (same result). Never touched: terrain, WoodsKit pieces (only their W_Tree_A / W_Boulder textures), monsters,
